 "intro_html": "The everyday hot soba: a clear dashi broth seasoned with sake, mirin, soy and salt, poured over soba that has been cooked, rinsed and warmed again. Toppings are JOC’s: baked frozen shrimp tempura, kamaboko, komatsuna and green onion. For a thicker, spicier bowl see <a href=\"curry-soba.html\">curry soba</a>; with chicken and leek, <a href=\"tori-nanban-soba.html\">tori nanban soba</a>.",
