  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Bring two large pots of water to a boil — one to cook, one to re-warm (the second is optional). No salt.</li><li>Cook the soba <b>30 seconds less</b> than the packet time.</li><li>Drain and rinse under cold running water, rubbing with your hand to wash off the starch.</li><li>Re-warm: 5–8 seconds in the second pot of boiling water — or JOC’s shortcut, a quick rinse under hot running water. Drain well and divide between the bowls.</li></ul>",
